{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "53d58ce0823d5a34eda1a91f463a3d3c881461e6266260f2f4ca5411899c9931", "ja": "ため息の理由", "zh": "叹气的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "840893cdcf8a2b52c0bd440477f8bb36c32b5d9024c027ba67e34b125eb3daf6", "ja": "公演のレッスンが始まったが、エミリーの元\n気がない。理由を聞くと、伊織に相応しくな\nいのではと悩んでいた。プロデューサーの言\n葉に背中を押されたエミリーは、伊織を信じ\nようと決意。その時……。", "zh": "演出的排练开始了，但艾米莉却打不起精神。一问\n原因，才知道她正苦恼着自己是不是配不上伊织。\n制作人的话给了艾米莉勇气，她下定决心要相信伊织。\n就在这时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6d86b4736d5541c344df26fefcce937404de84512301bc3c8dad0e07ed5918af", "ja": "（いよいよ、地方公演のレッスンが始まった。\n今日から雪歩が合流、伊織と春香は取材のため不在だ）", "zh": "（地方公演的排练终于开始了。从今天起雪步也加入进来，伊织和春香则因为采访而不在。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "832a40de961b5488b14943759a23124cd056ff6c2850892ef37265f6ff408b63", "ja": "はぁ～～～……。", "zh": "唉～～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e2c45ce7c7e477857664802239df450d1557db938fada2be384329e81991cac4", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n……ん？　エミリー……？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n……嗯？艾米莉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "723207f786a337068a2c525209ce62a5462c5afd31a9bf804509565d814bb16c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまですぅ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a48d36912c6bee77680eb36d2222aa50e22eecdde62cdb3f214322002f4a13b8", "ja": "お疲れさま、雪歩。今、エミリーが大きなため息を\n吐いてたけど……レッスンに何か問題でもあるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，雪步。刚才艾米莉叹了口大气……是课程出了什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "67e293080061f3245b0f734246a4699c5ae3142357ea6bf3da1f9cb0c35ae3d7", "ja": "そんなことないですよ？\n予定より早く進んでるって、先生もほめてくれました！", "zh": "没那回事哦？\n老师还夸我们进度比预定的更快呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dd50295bdd8e229e45840c0fd84dd3812568371db9f961cf17cab6b5299a90ba", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、今日はずっとあんな感じなんです。\n何か、悩みごとがあるのかも……。", "zh": "艾米莉今天一直都是那副样子。\n也许，她有什么烦恼吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "78ba7ab5c073b807acc61f5e0c006c98c4718b072e01832b6a0bf87dae99fbf0", "ja": "そうか……\nよし、ちょっと話をしてみようかな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n好，我去和她聊几句吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "d9cb08da9e868065e35eac4d6b37952bbfc76dca574cb7ed5131178f8a368a0a", "ja": "ふぅ～～～……。", "zh": "呼——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "21c9c5d295b918bc7c912b0c6f93e91bb4f6b66ff2c4aea6b6e7b8fb1e1a77fe", "ja": "お疲れさま、エミリー！\nレッスン、だいぶ順調らしいな。少し休憩しないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉！\n听说训练进行得相当顺利。要不要稍微休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "0fa8189a31210adcc6534865a796f2cae09dc586dbb7e16dea24535f9904c809", "ja": "あっ、仕掛け人さま！\nあの……でも、私……。", "zh": "啊，制作人！\n那个……可是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8bdbb09f8833017c56479131fe71ee2edb5402ace934650c80a1d7a0255878ea", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。{$P$}も\n来てくれたし、すこし休憩にしよう？", "zh": "艾米莉。{$P$}也来了，我们稍微休息一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "419423a271309a1d22cb5b9301b424298f8c4c333532c0614667612593d284f4", "ja": "わたし、お茶を取ってきますね！", "zh": "我去拿茶水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "4f484c25f473004dca4d97498ad7acfac57897cfb3bda5fde104a27723793477", "ja": "あ……は、はい……！", "zh": "啊……好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "786d8aeff8f83708b41ca7ff681373f303ac30cf9bf724a94ae2c4b5c2fe3f45", "ja": "雪歩さん、このお茶、とってもおいしいですね！\n日本茶ですか？", "zh": "雪步小姐，这茶真的很好喝呢！\n是日本茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e9136f657b9923cd95edca03bdfcd98f7750e0c701361584310fc65412a234d6", "ja": "うん、そうだよ。水出しで淹れたのを、\n魔法瓶に入れてきたの。口当たりがよくなるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是的。用冷泡的方式泡好后，装进保温瓶带过来的。这样喝起来会更顺口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9594b99a9d418d29d124e885c304119d4afb39f532e81af7f8403a0f733f06e8", "ja": "えっと……エミリーちゃん、どうかな？", "zh": "那个……艾米莉，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "d85e92e489690a31edf4b550d17680d03cc99349d0a92a0e7f79d1f9679c77b7", "ja": "えっ！？　は、はい！\nこのお抹茶、とてもおいしいですね！", "zh": "咦！？啊、好的！\n这个抹茶非常好喝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9fbe03f8ae321d48e757e133a4b2c8cd0f069c0e58005492ea621d573d3e7f99", "ja": "エミリー、これは普通の緑茶だと思うけど……。", "zh": "艾米莉，我觉得这只是普通的绿茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f1f08c50a108f3abf6abbd13c315e546e36582c2c2c4a1be614480f3aed1327", "ja": "はっ！？\nわ、私としたことが、失礼しました……！", "zh": "啊！？\n我、我居然会这样，真是失礼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ba9ea6c5e525f83b64d8adb358c1bf2524c0d6311f2d6a1a4f531168b510e723", "ja": "エミリー、さっきからため息が多いみたいだな。\n何か悩みがあるなら、言ってくれないか？", "zh": "艾米莉，你从刚才开始好像一直在叹气。\n如果有什么烦恼，可以告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2b10930571239f3d6970f1b7162864f873a8ee51bd95bb1c678fa179f6ceaedc", "ja": "雪歩も星梨花も、心配してるぞ。", "zh": "雪步和星梨花也都很担心你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "b910dcd72f78f98108d9998e5adef4e8bef3313ae4f9d04887805472536e7623", "ja": "えっ……あ！　も、申し訳ありません。\nその、悩みというほどのことではないのですが……。", "zh": "诶……啊！非、非常抱歉。\n那个，倒也算不上是什么烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "e524c8e15e1fbcbdcb8cc02acc61a9820dec66f51edb4d56e19bb08ce75df990", "ja": "私……今回の公演で、二人組で伊織さまの相手役を\nまかせていただけて、とても光栄に思っています。", "zh": "我……能在这次公演中，以二人组的形式担任伊织大人的搭档，感到非常荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "fc9723bd47d4b80cc06140f992a043b822e1e03ddcf2819686a269f11b12990f", "ja": "伊織さまは、立派な大和撫子ですし。\nけど、そんな伊織さまの相手として、私は……。", "zh": "伊织小姐可是位出色的大和抚子。可是，要成为这样的伊织小姐的搭档，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "70f7390ee95d326ffb75b42b58d8378457863816ea3e89279fe7502bc0f0067f", "ja": "なるほど。\nつまりエミリーは、伊織に相応しくなりたいんだな？", "zh": "原来如此。\n也就是说，艾米莉想成为配得上伊织的人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "b6083ea31d263e1d3f7b7568f46a6f3849299c3abdc605d8cd5a8fcf0dfbedd5", "ja": "は、はいっ！\n仕掛け人さま……私は、どうすれば良いでしょうか？", "zh": "是、是的！\n制作人先生……我该怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_1029", "source_sha256": "3d5fa161831ebd965d33fa7b56c7a3cfee9f8d7961f5069c12d1984141f70acb", "ja": "今のままで！", "zh": "就保持现在这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8c1c9bec7e390a7be0b2d43849f8106aa1b10367b2a950c2f523ae069a10c248", "ja": "エミリーは、今のままでいいと思う。\nレッスン、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "我觉得艾米莉保持现在这样就很好。\n一起努力练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2001_032emi", "source_sha256": "c3ede56e00a9b7c46d82996b8863d6c560e6bf6bf596bfa5ad018e1e7af9677c", "ja": "ええっ！？　け、けど……。", "zh": "诶！？可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2002_p", "source_sha256": "2763392e6043210d97ae0519c7d192ed0d6752a942a9bce2d319fe655e3148a1", "ja": "最初にデュオの話をした時、伊織も言ってただろ？\n気負わないで、楽しもうって。", "zh": "最开始聊二人组的时候，伊织也说过吧？\n别有压力，好好享受就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac1f60e497a5399b29b453091feec115ad3acf322e255a1709bef03a03d58a4a", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。わ、私なんかが言うのは、\nおこがましいかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "艾米莉。虽、虽然由我来说可能有些不自量力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f83d8442558df59f0c71282816548f48fce4bf1eabc54c7ac9adc03aa212ead5", "ja": "もし、もしもだよ？　エミリーちゃんに足りないことが\nあったら、伊織ちゃんが真っ先に言うんじゃないかな？", "zh": "要、要是说……只是要是哦？如果艾米莉有什么不足之处，伊织肯定会第一个指出来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2005_032emi", "source_sha256": "b5cc1bcb2a2dc95c934a1711b548f8edb80f3e7d92d58407492dc8fec10c135f", "ja": "え……あっ！", "zh": "诶……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2006_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e69da701ffcad55747fb5a2a2b317060213d0c5b0c77d51f2461004cf4cb0a6", "ja": "わたしも、そう思います！　伊織さんは、わたしが\nステップを間違えて覚えていた時、教えてくれました。", "zh": "我也这么觉得！之前我把舞步\n记错的时候，伊织小姐就提醒过我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2007_022ser", "source_sha256": "d8dc4bc442ce1d41096ad64cd6773eaea4bcf7b6cfa3dafb8f07b9f254c9db97", "ja": "それで、正しいステップを教えてくれたんです！\n厳しいですけど、とっても優しいですから……。", "zh": "所以，她教会了我正确的舞步！\n虽然要求很严格，但她真的非常温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2008_p", "source_sha256": "a2f6239c94e19af4c8da0515bf229818f3960b2ded8b9ca21c765bc99b3099e2", "ja": "エミリー。先輩っていうのは、時として\nすごく大きく見えるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "艾米莉。有时前辈看起来可能会高大得让人仰望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2009_p", "source_sha256": "01cf991cbfa3a6ca05b6f4d861a0db5cd2e0f22d2590fbd14110d32b49cb9444", "ja": "今回エミリーは、そんな先輩の隣に、同じ立場で\n立たなきゃいけない。見上げてばかりじゃダメなんだ。", "zh": "这次，艾米莉必须和那样的前辈并肩站在一起，以同等的身份。不能总是抬头仰望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2010_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2011_p", "source_sha256": "488751a049fb53da9137abae69728c7ba9851d648c472b1a0cd0ac9932cbca2c", "ja": "それに先輩といっても、伊織だってまだまだ、\nこれからのアイドルなんだ。そうだろ？　雪歩。", "zh": "而且就算说是前辈，伊织也还是处在成长中的偶像。对吧？雪步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4cb9ccafb0bfe1655d1f0cc179f328eaa0d7e382777575312ce193621a74ce12", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。私も、\nみんなに負けないように、がんばらなくちゃです！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。我也得努力，不能输给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2013_p", "source_sha256": "b3623020f52421141e7c16eb166d61facade2457a91c6780ddeeec0cb164de76", "ja": "だからここは、思いきって伊織に\n背中を預けてみてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "所以这次，不妨大胆地把后背交给伊织吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2014_p", "source_sha256": "a2c046bbc2f4c8e4fa7c0963f76547c4188f4537b0f3498b2a97e6d7af50b3bd", "ja": "それができるのが、デュオだと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，能做到这一点的，正是二重唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2015_032emi", "source_sha256": "4ed4c9e4c6cacfdd71db452ad2ddf1590b88b23d4428e00dc74d4fcd26e97dd0", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……は、はいっ！　伊織さまを信じて……\n私、背中を預けさせていただきます！", "zh": "策划大人……是、是的！我相信伊织大人……\n我会把后背托付给您的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2016_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ccb99837749bb841ecf153993e8f7cb444ab3bd1f2f608dbeca2aaa27074fa6", "ja": "エミリーちゃん……えへへっ。", "zh": "艾米莉……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc7fcf9618784b9fba2a0732326820bb240c417af7882304d61c38819d50364a", "ja": "ねえエミリーちゃん、星梨花ちゃん。\n休憩が終わったら、もう1回だけ合わせてみない？", "zh": "呐，艾米莉、小星梨花。  \n休息结束后，再合练1次，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "24fdb93726edd0a40742e65a2d9720929471680d6c8dce720c3dfc6afa9c8863", "ja": "私じゃ、伊織ちゃんの代わりにはならないかも\nだけど……少しは協力できたらなって。", "zh": "我可能没办法代替伊织……\n但要是能帮上一点忙就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2019_032emi", "source_sha256": "d43fc0280f7c36b2971f6b4c8e038991a6637736628f0c5bf8aa526ee3cc8884", "ja": "はいっ！\nぜひお願いします、雪歩さん！", "zh": "好的！\n雪歩前辈，拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2020_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e8d70e2dcc618fb8542a15804c810f1aa47e8011b9db1a830bb3d637ce67b1c", "ja": "わたしも、わからないところがあるので\n教えてほしいです、雪歩さん！", "zh": "我也有不明白的地方，\n想请您教教我，雪步小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_03_2022_p", "source_sha256": "fc74b49ac883ebeafde5a81a09626bb06ab737a6d801f8c041163d640c971dbf", "ja": "ん？　誰か来たのか……あっ。", "zh": "嗯？有人来了吗……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
